                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fa706df6-b271-3c6c-8428-e276a5768c44",
                        "entry_id": "3e4c647d-0653-3a64-ad5e-38e9b8b5fa90",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг., сниж. тот, кто много и легко, но бездарно пишет, занимается писательством, журналистикой; бумагомаратель, писака"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "97b216ec-40c5-4956-8eb3-77f227b6fa77",
                                "sense_id": "fa706df6-b271-3c6c-8428-e276a5768c44",
                                "text": "Преслеп: Этот щелкопёр, бусурман, который пьёт табак да волосы корчит?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "772a4e6b-728b-457a-91ea-12484bdb1738",
                                "sense_id": "fa706df6-b271-3c6c-8428-e276a5768c44",
                                "text": "Как думаете, сударь? Сами видите: щелкопёры нас одолевают. Пора, ей-ей пора дать им порядочный отпор."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82bdb23a-ece0-4114-8370-47e5a1eae183",
                                "sense_id": "fa706df6-b271-3c6c-8428-e276a5768c44",
                                "text": "Городничий: Разнесёт по всему свету историю; мало того что пойдёшь в посмешище — найдётся щелкопёр, бумагомарака, в комедию тебя вставит."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5598d2f0-8e15-48e2-84ec-30c3492d9c19",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e4c647d-0653-3a64-ad5e-38e9b8b5fa90",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa706df6-b271-3c6c-8428-e276a5768c44",
                        "target_lang_word": "scribbler",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "scribbler",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1868a7a3-507f-3135-8f21-cc76e036c53b",
                                        "entry_id": "3cd8f5ac-5e75-3447-846e-1cdc638a24ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who scribbles; a hasty or untalented writer or artist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "072ea513-6dc6-488d-88df-f4b4495efdf5",
                                                "sense_id": "1868a7a3-507f-3135-8f21-cc76e036c53b",
                                                "text": "The scribbler, pinch'd with hunger, writes to dine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6778315-cd0a-497b-b837-3ad4f4300b0a",
                                                "sense_id": "1868a7a3-507f-3135-8f21-cc76e036c53b",
                                                "text": "\"That's what I have been talking to you, sir - scientific gibberish! Did you think you could match cunning with me - you with your walnut of a brain? You think you are omnipotent, you infernal scribblers, don't you? That your praise can make a man and your blame can break him?\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9d83ef87-3608-3818-8d03-190a307f0d9f",
                                        "entry_id": "3cd8f5ac-5e75-3447-846e-1cdc638a24ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A machine for coarse carding or teasing of wool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11d2c69d-a8c7-3433-91d0-e7288148829c",
                                        "entry_id": "3cd8f5ac-5e75-3447-846e-1cdc638a24ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ruled notebook or exercise book, especially in grade school."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d69db31a-7435-4ac8-84b2-cbfb9226648c",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e4c647d-0653-3a64-ad5e-38e9b8b5fa90",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa706df6-b271-3c6c-8428-e276a5768c44",
                        "target_lang_word": "pen-pusher",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pen-pusher",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec405466-bf33-3561-916a-9eb521e52be4",
                                        "entry_id": "2f295066-b20f-3121-a533-c579482e5822",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who performs routine office work, involving mainly paperwork."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "informal",
                                            "often"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a30bf10a-b1c1-411a-9559-3b812856f212",
                                                "sense_id": "ec405466-bf33-3561-916a-9eb521e52be4",
                                                "text": "A pen-pusher in a Sixth ave. office said a coal miner is paid well. I asked him if he ever dug coal. Oh no!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6350375-14c8-4444-9685-a959f7808842",
                                                "sense_id": "ec405466-bf33-3561-916a-9eb521e52be4",
                                                "text": "\"I had to prove to people who were unimportant, who'd never achieved anything in their lives—the administrator, the pen-pusher—that I could fight.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af8722d8-40a6-4d26-ae30-8f998564cf21",
                                                "sense_id": "ec405466-bf33-3561-916a-9eb521e52be4",
                                                "text": "Investors may have a lopsided view of the company’s reputation simply because an uncaring pen pusher in the finance department responded lethargically to an investor’s query."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
